  "headline": "Adenosine supply at three Corvale sites ranges from 18 to 21 days on hand; the HealthFirst label (NDC 51662145003) is linked to a U.S. relabeler last inspected VAI 2025-06-26, and the Gland Pharma label (NDC 68083015610) is linked to an India manufacturer last inspected VAI 2024-07-25; Eugia US LLC is not on FDA's shortage list today but its label names no plant we could place.",
  "headline_cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3", "E14", "E13", "E21", "E20"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 806 units at 45.5 per day for 18 days on hand, Corvale General holds 605 units at 31.8 per day for 19 days, and Corvale Lakeside holds 96 units at 4.5 per day for 21 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The HealthFirst label (NDC 51662145003) identifies HF Acquisition Co LLC as a U.S. relabeler with FEI 3014534, last inspected VAI on 2025-06-26.",
      "cites": ["E14", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Gland Pharma label (NDC 68083015610) identifies Gland Pharma Limited as an India manufacturer with FEI 3002647489, last inspected VAI on 2024-07-25.",
      "cites": ["E21", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Eugia US LLC is not on FDA's shortage list today, but its label names no plant we could place.",
